      <version value="1.0"/>
      <Notice value="âMetro Sansâ was built with FontStruct
Designer description: I made this, because I was bothered with the quality of the font used on the displays of the Copenhagen Metro. So this is an attempt to make a better font under the same restrictions (i.e. a display with a height of 14 LED lamps). The o - and possibly other characters - are the same as in the current font. But I made sure the M became similar to the logo of the metro. Don't mind the IPA, I just went a bit wild...
"/>
